# Generated sources. These are already gitignored, but that is not enough:
# prettier does not read nested .gitignore files, so a whole-repo run
# (`nx format:check --all`) picks them straight back up. Listing them here is
# what keeps the CI gate honest.
#
# - proto gen output      → libs/proto/gateway/.gitignore  (verified: 4 files
#                           reported by `nx format:check --all` before this entry)
# - i18n generated types  → root .gitignore (#260); the artifact also carries its
#                           own /* prettier-ignore */ header, so this is belt-and-braces
# - prisma client         → libs/database/.gitignore; prettier-clean today, but that
#                           is a property of the current codegen, not a guarantee
/libs/proto/gateway/src/gen
/libs/common/i18n/src/lib/generated
/libs/database/src/lib/generated
